*References:* D. J. Griffiths, *Introduction to Electrodynamics* (Cambridge Univ. Press), ch. 5 (Biot–Savart, solenoid) · E. M. Purcell & D. J. Morin, *Electricity and Magnetism* (Cambridge Univ. Press) · D. W. McRobbie et al., *MRI from Picture to Proton* (Cambridge Univ. Press), chapter on MR hardware · R. W. Brown et al., *Magnetic Resonance Imaging: Physical Principles and Sequence Design*, 2nd ed. (Wiley), chapters on magnet and gradient design.
